>I keep getting 'tricked' at mines level 5. what is going on? Just as I
>descend from the 4th level, the program gives me, "thismap is not as I
>remember it. There is some trickery here." I've done no file mods or been
>cheating in any way. How can I fix this, other than replacing the file?

This garbage happened to me too, and the solution was to back up the
log and record files and to reinstall from the virgin zipfile.  That
fixed it.  The problem seemed to corrolate to bones levels, so you
might try deleting just those files and see if that helps.  At least
you're being hit at level 5 of the mines, rather than at levels 17 and
24 like I was.

Save your game and backup your savefile before taking the steps down
to level 5, just in case.  If you're on a multiuser system and you
can't do this, get the system operator to reinstall NetHack if you 
can, since you probably can't tweak things easily.  This is not a common
problem, but once it starts happening on a system, it keeps happening.

